# Task: re-review the revised implementation plan (round {{.Round}})

The author revised the plan after the earlier review. Check every earlier finding against the revised package and give each one exactly one status in previous_findings:
- "resolved": the revision fixes it;
- "unresolved": it is not fixed (say what is still missing);
- "dispute_accepted": the author disputed it and is right;
- "dispute_rejected": the author disputed it and is wrong (say why).

## Earlier findings and the author's responses (unverified)
{{range .Previous}}{{data (printf "finding %s" .Finding.ID) (printf "id: %s\nseverity: %s\ndimension: %s\nlocation: %s\ntitle: %s\ndescription: %s\nrequired_change: %s\nauthor_response: %s\nauthor_detail: %s" .Finding.ID .Finding.Severity .Finding.Dimension .Finding.Location .Finding.Title .Finding.Description .Finding.RequiredChange (or (and .Response .Response.Response) "none") (or (and .Response .Response.Detail) "none"))}}

{{end}}
Then review the whole revised package again; report only problems that are not earlier findings as new findings.
